    "finalName": "",
    "description": "This Talent allows you to redirect a deflected blaster bolt along a specific trajectory, so that it damages another creature or object in its path. Once per round when you successfully <b>Deflect</b> a blaster bolt, you can make an immediate ranged attack against another target with which you have line of sight.<br><br>Apply the normal range penalties to the attack roll, not counting the distance the bolt traveled to reach you. If the attack succeeds, it deals normal weapon damage to the target. Only single blaster bolts can be redirected in this manner. Barrages from <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> weapons and other types of projectiles can't be redirected.",
